  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_1999.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El local PaKopes, en la avenida Mont&iacute;, 20 de Tales, ha acogido la tarde-noche de este viernes su tercer concierto dentro de las fiestas patronales. Nagore Serrano, Edgar Gargallo, Cristian Rodr&iacute;guez y Pedrito S&aacute;nchez han protagonizado una fiesta flamenca. Este s&aacute;bado es el turno de la Orkesta Pelillo, con sus originales versiones de grandes temas del punk-rock.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_1999.jpg\" alt=\"img_1999\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2000.jpg\" alt=\"img_2000\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2003.jpg\" alt=\"img_2003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2004.jpg\" alt=\"img_2004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2006.jpg\" alt=\"img_2006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2007.jpg\" alt=\"img_2007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2009.jpg\" alt=\"img_2009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2011.jpg\" alt=\"img_2011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaflamencapakopes/img_2014.jpg\" alt=\"